{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>And they shall place upon it all its vessels.</b> It did not mention the pots but only the מחתה, and the מחתה served three purposes: with it they would carry fire onto the altar during the journeys, to fulfill what is said: אש תמיד תוקד על המזבח; and with it they would remove the ashes outside the camp. And during the sacrificial service they would throw it from the ramp onto the floor, and every priest or Levite who heard its sound would come running."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:16:26.910536116Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}